<html><body><article><div class='post-content'>Exciting news from Yale's Z-CAFE! We're thrilled to welcome Yao Sun as a predoctoral fellow. Yao Sun holds a Master's degree in Survey Methodology from the University of Michigan and a Bachelor of Science in Sociology from the University of Wisconsin-Madison. Yao Sun will be joining the lab in New Haven at Yale University.</div></article></body></html>

