<html><body><main id='student-profile'><h1>Yao Sun</h1><p>Yao Sun is an M.S. student in the Michigan Program in Survey and Data Science at the University of Michigan. Yao Sun earned a Bachelor of Science in Sociology from the University of Wisconsin-Madison. Yao Sun previously worked as an undergraduate research assistant in the Department of Sociology at the University of Wisconsin-Madison.</p></main></body></html>

